*&      Form  Z_feed_table 
*&---------------------------------------------------------------------* 
  " Fazendo um select simples pra traze algum dado pra nos podemos visualizar 
  " no nosso ALV bunitão. 
 
  " não entende sobre select, clique aki : 
 
  " http://abapjuniores.blogspot.com/2011/06/for-all-entries-in-basico.html 
 
FORM z_feed_table . 
 
  SELECT vbeln 
  INTO TABLE it_vbak 
  FROM vbak. 
 
 
*Buscar o numero do material, para isso tem acessar VBAK-VBELN igual VBAP-VBELN e buscar o campo VBAP-MATNR 
  IF it_vbak[] IS NOT INITIAL. 
    SELECT vbeln matnr UP TO 10 ROWS "TRAZER NO MAXIMO 10 LINHAS 
    INTO TABLE it_vbap 
    FROM vbap 
    FOR ALL ENTRIES IN it_vbak 
    WHERE vbeln = it_vbak-vbeln. 
 
*Buscar status de remessa e valor faturado, para isso tem acessar VBAK-VBELN igual VBUK-VBELN e buscar o campo VBUK-LFSTK 
 
    SELECT vbeln lfstk 
    INTO TABLE it_vbuk 
    FROM vbuk 
    FOR ALL ENTRIES IN it_vbak 
    WHERE vbeln = it_vbak-vbeln. 
 
*Buscar o Valor Faturado, para isso tem que acessar VBAK-VBELN igual VBRK-VBELN e trazer o campo VBRK-NETWR 
 
    SELECT vbeln netwr 
    INTO TABLE it_vbrk 
    FROM vbrk 
    FOR ALL ENTRIES IN IT_VBaK 
    WHERE vbeln = it_vbak-vbeln. 
 
  ENDIF. 
 
 
  LOOP AT it_vbak INTO wa_vbak. 
 
    wa_alv-vbeln = wa_vbak-vbeln. 
 
    READ TABLE it_vbap INTO wa_vbap WITH KEY vbeln = wa_vbak-vbeln. 
    IF sy-subrc IS INITIAL. 
      wa_alv-matnr = wa_vbap-matnr. 
 
    ENDIF. 
 
    READ TABLE it_vbuk INTO wa_vbuk WITH KEY vbeln = wa_vbak-vbeln. 
    IF sy-subrc IS INITIAL. 
      wa_alv-lfstk = wa_vbuk-lfstk. 
 
    ENDIF. 
 
    READ TABLE it_vbrk INTO wa_vbrk WITH KEY vbeln = wa_vbak-vbeln. 
    IF sy-subrc IS INITIAL. 
      wa_alv-netwr = wa_vbrk-netwr. 
 
    ENDIF. 
 
 
    APPEND wa_alv TO it_alv. 
 
  ENDLOOP. 
  . 
 
ENDFORM.                    " Z_feed_table 
 
